#: ../../../users/crashrep.rst:3
msgid "Automatic crash reporting is available from version 1.2.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../users/crashrep.rst:8
msgid "Automatic Crash Reporting"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../users/crashrep.rst:10
msgid ""
"Automatic crash reporting sends reports of crashes or \"panics\" to the "
"developers of Syncthing. This crash report contains the version information "
"of Syncthing (equivalent to the output of ``syncthing --version``) and a "
"technical trace of what the various threads / routines in Syncthing were "
"doing at the time of the crash."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../users/crashrep.rst:13
msgid ""
"The crash report does not include log data, file names, device IDs, "
"statistics, a unique identifier, or any other personally identifiable "
"information. Crash reporting is enabled out of the box for most users, but "
"can be disabled in the :ref:`advanced configuration dialog <advanced>`."
msgstr ""

