#: ../../../users/crashrep.rst:43
msgid ""
"Note that the username and hostname of the machine where Syncthing was built "
"will be included in the crash log as part of the version string. This "
"information is essential for the developers to interpret the log in context. "
"If you compile Syncthing locally and want to prevent your build from having "
"such data embedded, see :ref:`versiontagging`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../users/crashrep.rst:49
msgid ""
